  "preregistered_gates_verbatim": {
    "G0_prerequisite": "w1024 Battery-A accuracy >= 0.90 in BOTH new seeds, else INCONCLUSIVE for that seed (battery or training broken, not a refutation of the law).",
    "G1_positive_control": "kv accuracy >= 0.80 in all 8 new cells. This is the control p1b failed and p1c repaired; it must be re-earned, not assumed.",
    "G2_reproduction": "Before scoring any new checkpoint, re-score seed 2100's checkpoints on this same battery and reproduce p1d's reported values exactly (0.262695/0.477539/0.725098/0.995117). On failure the whole run is VOID. This is the only defence against models.py reading its attention window from an import-time global (S05_WINDOW), which fails silently with plausible output.",
